*****************************************************************************************
* INPUT                                                                                 *
*****************************************************************************************
../Average.out                 :: Voronoi cell nodes
../raypaths.out                :: Raypaths
*****************************************************************************************
* BOUNDING BOX                                                                          *
*****************************************************************************************
bound.gmt                      :: GMT plotting bounds for depth slice
*****************************************************************************************
* VELOCITY GRID PARAMETERS                                                              *
*****************************************************************************************
209     193                    :: Number of nodes in latitude/y and longitude/x
61     48                      :: Coordinates of north/top and south/bottom edge of grid
-9     3                       :: Coordinates of west/left and east/right edge of grid
20    20                       :: Dicing in latitude/y and longitude/x
grid2dva.z                     :: GMT output file for velocity slice
*****************************************************************************************
* RAY PATH PARAMETERS                                                                   *
*****************************************************************************************
1                              :: Plot raypaths? (0=no,1=yes)
rays.dat                       :: Output ray path file for depth slice
*****************************************************************************************